OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening, the odd shower possible
OL,7,Fin the west. Then the rest of the
OL,8,Fnight will be largely with clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Brisk southwesterly winds.
